cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software, please cite this repository and both AUIST
  project reports (December 2024 DTI / graph transformer, and May 2025 GRAND).
title: "Graph models for drug discovery"
abstract: >
  Two-phase graph-ML release by Ashwin Prabhu M (Register No. 2023176029).
  GitHub phase1/ (package dti_gt) is KIBA drug–target affinity from the
  December 2024 AUIST report. GitHub phase2/ (package hgdr) is the released
  EHR+DDI subset of GRAND from the May 2025 AUIST report. University PDFs
  self-describe as “Phase-I”; that label is not the GitHub folder numbering.
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BlackAsh01/graph-drug-discovery"
keywords:
  - drug-target interaction
  - graph transformer
  - KIBA
  - ProtBERT
  - binding affinity
  - medication recommendation
  - GRAND
  - drug-drug interaction
  - MIMIC-III
authors:
