    notes: >
      M.Tech. (Information Technology — AI & DS) AUIST Phase-I project report,
      December 2024. Register No. 2023176029. Supervisor: Dr. T. Mala.
      Cover title is the CVD wording; the report body is KIBA drug–target
      interaction prediction with a graph transformer and ProtBERT.
      PDF has no Keywords section; abstract terms include DTI, Graph Transformer,
      ProtBERT, KIBA, SMILES, RDKit, multi-head attention, binding affinity.
      Repository folder: phase1/ (package dti_gt).
    url: "https://github.com/BlackAsh01/graph-drug-discovery"
